PAINT image - paint in graphics canvas

The mouse is used for drawing and positioning.
Click and drag to draw, depending on the mode.

The following keys are available:

  P             point mode (default)
  L             draw a line
  J             draw joined lines
  R             draw a rectangle
  O             draw a circle
  T             write text
  F             flood fill an enclosed area
  E             erase a rectangular area

  M             toggle white, inverse and black
  C             clear the entire image

  ESC           exit current mode
  BACKSPACE     undo the last operation

  W             write image to disk
  Q             write image to disk and quit
  K             quit without writing to disk
  
  At the Pascal command level, the following
  commamnds are available:
  
  SNAP image    Make a snapshot of the current      
                graphics window
                
  VIEW image    View a saved image